---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="占位符" lang="zh"><section class="cover"><h1>姓名占位符</h1><div class="cover-content"><p>图像占位符</p><ul><li>个人信息占位符</li><li>联系方式占位符</li><li>ORCID 占位符</li><li>GitHub 占位符</li><li>简历占位符</li></ul><p>简短陈述占位符。</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
<style>.cover { min-height: 55vh; display: grid; align-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-xl); } .cover-content { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule); max-width: var(--text-width); padding-top: var(--space-sm); } ul { list-style: none; margin: var(--space-md) 0; padding: 0; }</style>
